Bug 1 — Error when hiding a selected element

Description:
When an element is selected and then made invisible using the “hide” action, an error occurs immediately.

Observed Behavior:

An error message is shown:
“A BoundingBoxController was used after being disposed. Once you have called dispose() on a BoundingBoxController, it can no longer be used.”

After the error appears, other elements in the editor no longer behave correctly.

Expected Behavior:

Hiding a selected element should not trigger any errors.

The editor should remain fully functional after the action.

